     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Entacapone w a nonselective MAOI (eg, phenelzine, tranylcypromine) could inhibit most catecholamine met; it can be taken w selective MAO-B inhibitors (eg, selegiline). Give drugs met by COMT (eg, isoproterenol, Epi, NE, DA, dobutamine, methyldopa, apomorphine) w caution, by any route."
     }
